  "claim_boundary": "This is a new development-only adaptive stabilization lineage after the terminal all-noop diagnosis of theta0 v1. It deliberately reuses source-v3 outcomes and the failed f44e theta0, so it is double-used, not unseen, confirmatory, or formal evidence. A schedule based only on frozen root/decision positions forces 96 owner-recommendation roles and 96 neutral-noop roles through the actual executor and reactive environment, settles PE-derived credit without online gate mutation, then applies one exact chronological batch once. Success requires at least one physically non-noop selected action when the final candidate is cold-replayed on the same 192 training-support forecasts. That weak gate only permits publication of a candidate theta0 v2 for a separately frozen public opportunity scanner; it does not authorize a source-v4 campaign, establish any ability effect, qualify the reader, or support human or production claims. Failure is terminal for this protocol: no schedule, order, base checkpoint, threshold, bias, seed, or early checkpoint may be selected after seeing output."
